      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "> Of particular interest are UpdateEnvironment and SetEnvironmentData methods on DynamicGI class. [...]\n\nI'd like to bump this specifically. Creating a map with a day night cycle, or any other lighting changes currently either won't look good or has significant performance impact when faking ambient lighting with 1 or 2 extra directional lignths.",
